  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You shift and alter your physiology freely, unable to settle on one – a trait that your paired soul delights in. You gain the Blood Code and Evolved Code feat. If you already have the Blood Code feat, you gain the Evolved Code feat twice instead. This does not count towards the limit of times you can take Evolved Code. Whenever you use Synergism, Refocus, or Learn Anima Magic, you can change one selection you have made for Blood Code, an Evolved Code feat you have taken, or an Apex Code feat if you have taken that feat.</p>"
